ExecutorLiquidityLens
├── Aave withdrawal
│   ├── It limits withdrawals by collateral solvency and available pool cash
│   ├── It rejects insolvent accounts even for non-collateral withdrawals
│   ├── It preserves solvency across fuzzed debt balances
│   ├── It returns zero for eMode, paused and inactive reserves
│   ├── It reserves native-unit rounding for low-decimal collateral
│   └── On a mainnet fork it withdraws collateral without making outstanding debt unhealthy
└── Morpho V2 withdrawal
    ├── It accounts for accrued interest and fee-share dilution
    ├── It uses idle assets and only the configured exit market
    ├── It skips preview and adapter queries for accounts with zero shares
    ├── It counts only idle assets for unknown adapters
    ├── It uses native maxWithdraw for wrapped V1 vaults
    ├── It enforces nested V2 exit gates
    └── It reverts when required protocol reads fail
